# === INCLUDED in this repo (full snapshot of the deliverable) ===
# data/raw/banknote.csv       — OpenML 1462 cache (46 KB, fully reproducible)
# models/*.joblib             — trained stacking_calibrated + scaler (9.2 MB)
# models/model_metadata.json  — model name + version + threshold
# reports/audit_pack.json     — Six Sigma audit pack
# reports/model_card.md       — model card
# reports/control_plan.md     — operational control plan
# reports/sipoc.md            — SIPOC + CTQ tree
# reports/figures/*.png       — ROC + confusion matrix + calibration + CV DPMO
# notebooks/*.ipynb           — 3 executed notebooks with outputs embedded
